 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                  MASTER SERVICES\n14 King Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom                  AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB435361854\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                    Westbrook Pharma Ltd\n14 King Street                                          14 King Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                           BS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom                                          United Kingdom\nVAT: GB435361854\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 11/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Leeds\n(\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Bristol (\"Party\nB\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Harry Whitfield\n Party B   Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Oliver Bennett\n Date      11/02/2026",
